  "preflight": "Existing six-file sample probe parsed first1000 rows/file in .0121-.0165s. Full raw+unique scan estimate about16s; target-passage native tokenization plus existing-resource hashing and tokenizer-only inspection must remain under the fixed120s wall-clock cap. No analyzer has been run for this draft.",
  "protocol": [
    "Queries exactly reproduce frozen FN categories pool_missing_exact_span_overlap_only269 and pool_missing_any_overlapping_span115; linked337 and NIL47. Frozen evaluator consumes literal exact atoms first and then a remaining gold NIL consumes one remaining prediction atom. No gold ID canonicalization.",
    "Replay unchanged native sentence/token offsets and the existing fixed2-to8 candidate generator only on query-containing passages. Verify every generated coordinate and source word index against both models existing raw cache rows for those passages.",
    "Stream all three neural raw and all three sibling unique-cache files; check every SHA, byte count and row count. Retain diagnostic query coordinates and query word tuples only. Verify coordinate unique_index against its sibling cache.",
    "Stream all three unchanged canonical files and assert all384 query atoms lack any exact canonical span. Distinguish generated raw coordinates later removed, cached word tuples without a coordinate, and absence from both.",
    "Use actual tokenizer small files only, offline with USE_TORCH/TF/FLAX=0; reproduce existing lowercase input words and maxlen32 to report tokenizer truncation. Do not load weights or invoke NN inference.",
    "Apply the pre-existing current-HPO map to model output IDs only. Report conditional top1/top3 supply with literal gold IDs and remaining-NIL consumption; separately report existing rounded5dp top1>.95 gate evidence. No new threshold or policy is selected.",
    "Write diagnostic per-query audit and aggregate summary only. No new candidate pool, prediction file, quality score, fit or originaldev read."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Error-conditioned training-side diagnosis is not a held-out generalization estimate, an achievable metric upper bound, or a candidate/decoder policy.",
    "A word-tuple cache hit without a coordinate is separated from a candidate at the gold span; standalone-fragment tuple hits are weaker evidence than full-passage token alignment.",
    "Model current-HPO mapping does not canonicalize gold literal IDs; compound gold atoms remain separate and joint recoverability is not assumed.",
    "Existing top1 gate and cached top3 support do not establish downstream precision, native hybrid acceptance or selector acceptance.",
    "Tokenizer truncation is inspected without weight loading or new neural outputs; it does not establish the causal effect on predictions.",
    "No originaldev, fit, GPU, new inference, decoding modification or threshold optimization."
  ],
